+# Dataset
+
+`dataset/` is the canonical location for dataset assets used by this project.
+
+```text
+dataset/
+├── README.md
+├── labels/
+│   ├── frame_manifest.csv
+│   ├── object_gt.csv
+│   └── ...
+└── *.ply
+```
+
+Rules:
+
+- committed benchmark/generated PLY frames live directly under `dataset/`;
+- GT, labels, manifests, pair definitions and dataset metadata live under `dataset/labels/`;
+- repository-root PLY files are forbidden;
+- the legacy root-level `labels/` directory is forbidden;
+- interactive `USER_*.ply` files are runtime artifacts and are ignored by Git.
+
+Dataset file names stored in CSV metadata remain dataset-relative names such as:
+
+```text
+D01_F00_full_l1_before_l2.ply
+```
+
+They must not be rewritten to absolute paths or prefixed with `dataset/`.
